      "content": "Wait, sorry—I think I misread your last part. I'm not really looking for metaphors, I just need the actual technical specs and the engineering math for the Vancouver building code. Can you skip the analogies and just give me the actual formulas for calculating those loads and how they affect the joist and post spacing? I need to make sure this thing is actually safe.",
